## 🔄 Data Flow

```
1. User Registration → Phone verification → Profile setup
2. Buyer browses products → Adds to cart → Checkout
3. Cart items → Payment processing → Order creation
4. Order → Seller fulfillment → Delivery tracking
5. Admin monitors → Manages disputes → Platform maintenance
```

